{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":12,"ref":"2-chronicles 25:12","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"yo","chapter":25,"translation":"Àwọn ọmọ Yehudah sì mú ẹ̀wà ẹgbàajọ míràn gbé ní àyè, wọ́n sì gbé wọn dé orí àpáta, wọ́n sì sọ wọn bọ́ láti orí àpáta náà, gbogbo wọn sì ya wéré-wéré.","tokens":[{"surface":"ועשרת","gloss":"ẹ̀wà ... míràn"},{"surface":"אלפים","gloss":"ẹgbàajọ"},{"surface":"חיים","gloss":"ní àyè"},{"surface":"שבו","gloss":"wọ́n mú ... gbé"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"àwọn ọmọ"},{"surface":"יהודה","gloss":"Yehudah"},{"surface":"ויביאום","gloss":"wọ́n sì gbé wọn dé"},{"surface":"לראש","gloss":"orí"},{"surface":"הסלע","gloss":"àpáta"},{"surface":"וישליכום","gloss":"wọ́n sì sọ wọn bọ́"},{"surface":"מראש","gloss":"láti orí"},{"surface":"הסלע","gloss":"àpáta náà"},{"surface":"וכלם","gloss":"gbogbo wọn sì"},{"surface":"נבקעו","gloss":"ya wéré-wéré"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T05:32:57.829238011Z","model":"glm-5.3"}